emplates reference.\"}],[\"/why\",{\"id\":\"/why\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Why Zellij Agent Threads\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"Docs\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why\"}],[\"/why-0\",{\"id\":\"/why-0\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why\",\"content\":\"Why Zellij Agent Threads exists, and what problem it solves.\"}],[\"/why-1\",{\"id\":\"/why-1\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#why-zellij-agent-threads\",\"content\":\"Why Zellij Agent Threads\"}],[\"/why-2\",{\"id\":\"/why-2\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"The problem\"}],[\"/why-3\",{\"id\":\"/why-3\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#the-model\",\"content\":\"The model\"}],[\"/why-4\",{\"id\":\"/why-4\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#the-default-view\",\"content\":\"The default view\"}],[\"/why-5\",{\"id\":\"/why-5\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#what-this-project-optimizes-for\",\"content\":\"What this project optimizes for\"}],[\"/why-6\",{\"id\":\"/why-6\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#why-zellij\",\"content\":\"Why Zellij\"}],[\"/why-7\",{\"id\":\"/why-7\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#current-limits\",\"content\":\"Current limits\"}],[\"/why-8\",{\"id\":\"/why-8\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-zellij-agent-threads\",\"content\":\"Zellij Agent Threads shows active AI Agents inside Zellij.\"}],[\"/why-9\",{\"id\":\"/why-9\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-zellij-agent-threads\",\"content\":\"It gives you one terminal-native panel for Agents that run across tabs, panes, and worktrees.\"}],[\"/why-10\",{\"id\":\"/why-10\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Agent work spreads quickly.\"}],[\"/why-11\",{\"id\":\"/why-11\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"One Agent can run in a feature worktree. Another Agent can run tests in a different tab. A third Agent can sit idle after a review.\"}],[\"/why-12\",{\"id\":\"/why-12\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"After a few prompts, tab names are not enough. You need to know where each Agent lives and what each Agent is doing.\"}],[\"/why-13\",{\"id\":\"/why-13\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Zellij Agent Threads answers these questions:\"}],[\"/why-14\",{\"id\":\"/why-14\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Which Agents are running?\"}],[\"/why-15\",{\"id\":\"/why-15\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Which Agents are idle?\"}],[\"/why-16\",{\"id\":\"/why-16\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Which tab contains an Agent?\"}],[\"/why-17\",{\"id\":\"/why-17\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Which pane contains an Agent?\"}],[\"/why-18\",{\"id\":\"/why-18\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Which worktree does the Agent use?\"}],[\"/why-19\",{\"id\":\"/why-19\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Which Agents belong to this Zellij session?\"}],[\"/why-20\",{\"id\":\"/why-20\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-model\",\"content\":\"A harness gives Agent state to `agent-threads`.\"}],[\"/why-21\",{\"id\":\"/why-21\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-model\",\"content\":\"Pi is the first supported harness. Its extension is a wrapper that turns Pi lifecycle events into `agent-threads` CLI calls.\"}],[\"/why-22\",{\"id\":\"/why-22\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-model\",\"content\":\"The CLI writes Agent Reports to SQLite. The Zellij plugin reads snapshots from the CLI and renders a panel.\"}],[\"/why-23\",{\"id\":\"/why-23\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-default-view\",\"content\":\"The default panel groups Agents by Zellij tab:\"}],[\"/why-24\",{\"id\":\"/why-24\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-default-view\",\"content\":\"The panel also shows pane data, model data, titles, current tools, and recent plugin events.\"}],[\"/why-25\",{\"id\":\"/why-25\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#what-this-project-optimizes-for\",\"content\":\"Zellij Agent Threads optimizes for a small live overview.\"}],[\"/why-26\",{\"id\":\"/why-26\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#what-this-project-optimizes-for\",\"content\":\"It is not an Agent runner. It does not start Agents. It does not replace Pi, Zellij, or your task tracker.\"}],[\"/why-27\",{\"id\":\"/why-27\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#what-this-project-optimizes-for\",\"content\":\"It only answers one question: what is active in this Zellij session?\"}],[\"/why-28\",{\"id\":\"/why-28\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-zellij\",\"content\":\"Zellij already knows the terminal layout.\"}],[\"/why-29\",{\"id\":\"/why-29\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-zellij\",\"content\":\"It knows tabs, panes, clients, and sessions. It can host a plugin pane next to your terminals. It can focus a pane when you click an entry.\"}],[\"/why-30\",{\"id\":\"/why-30\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-zellij\",\"content\":\"This makes Zellij a good place for the Agent overview.\"}],[\"/why-31\",{\"id\":\"/why-31\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#current-limits\",\"content\":\"This project is in early development.\"}],[\"/why-32\",{\"id\":\"/why-32\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#current-limits\",\"content\":\"The first supported harness is Pi. Other harnesses can integrate by writing Agent Reports to the `agent-threads` CLI.\"}],[\"/why-33\",{\"id\":\"/why-33\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#current-limits\",\"content\":\"The template API can change while the project is young. Pin release versions when you share templates across machines.\"}]]"}}